  vendorName: Magnate Rutherford
  offerText: Invest in my automated cleaning contraption. It commands a heavy price
    and dominates a room, but it will keep your quarters entirely spotless.
  acceptResultText: You plug the massive machine in. It whirs loudly for five seconds,
    completely short-circuits, and dies. It does absolutely nothing but take up your
    money and space.
  rejectResultText: You refuse to buy his mechanical junk.
  acceptedDelayedText: 
  rejectedDelayedText: You feel quite satisfied keeping your hard-earned funds.
